Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.85,OP,,0,0,0,,好胜其实是认真的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:45.52,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算这么说 你也不会相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:48.06,OP,,0,0,0,,所谓的常识 有时只是枷锁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:50.77,OP,,0,0,0,,正因为未知 才更值得去挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:53.36,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士 还是路边的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.36,0:04:55.86,OP,,0,0,0,,为了找到答案 我选择迎战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:05:01.16,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃烧的热情如闪电般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.91,0:05:06.74,OP,,0,0,0,,无论你变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:11.04,OP,,0,0,0,,并肩作战的意志绝不动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:15.88,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:21.13,OP,,0,0,0,,只为遇见令人热血沸腾的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:28.02,OP,,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀锋指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:33.19,OP,,0,0,0,,唤醒内心温柔的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.19,0:05:38.07,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸腾燃烧的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:42.49,OP,,0,0,0,,将绝望的气息一刀斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.41,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用这把“真剑”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:28.12,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷电击中 内心翻腾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:36.04,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的预感 第一次在心底悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.63,ED,,0,0,0,,努力过后的冰淇淋奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.68,ED,,0,0,0,,在特别的日子里分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.55,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此摆出美味的神情对视
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.64,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.48,ED,,0,0,0,,这些闪闪发光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.61,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:03.74,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在许愿 像是在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:07.45,ED,,0,0,0,,细细地品味每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:11.37,ED,,0,0,0,,在朴素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地点缀色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:19.38,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法 离不开你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.22,ED,,0,0,0,,这股让人无法抗拒的悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,自古以来 这个世界就存在着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,足以撼动天地的强大之剑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那些剑曾无数次擦出激烈火花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,让世界陷入混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但随着和平降临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.55,0:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,它们的存在也逐渐被遗忘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 时代来到现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有两个追求力量的少年现身
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.13,0:01:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他们命中注定的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那沉睡的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如今将再次苏醒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.90,0:01:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,呜啦 来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,吼！嗷呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 老爸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这样真的会有猎物上钩吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,忍耐也是修行的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你就这样撑着 总有一天会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧 影虎？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.58,0:02:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,丛林之王也不过如此嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,庄之介
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.83,0:03:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于打倒丛林之王啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-故意露出破绽\N-成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-等对方上钩再一击命中\N-成功啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,完全照计划走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哼 面对大猩猩也能轻松获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这里可是丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,弱肉强食就是大自然的法则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.35,0:03:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-撤退\N-呦呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.29,0:03:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们好像还没发现我们的存在耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想试试看被食物包围\N并住在里面是什么感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.76,0:03:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那我们趁现在快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.72,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿咻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,动作快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.14,0:06:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,（成田国际机场）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.60,0:06:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,日本航空5701班机即将抵达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加 你特地来接我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你在剑道亚洲大赛夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,超厉害的 根本已经万夫莫敌了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.67,0:06:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不过…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那家伙…还有铁剑十郎在
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,只要…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不打倒那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不能称作真正的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,爸…爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,修行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,修行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.23,0:07:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.49,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你还挺强的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.41,0:07:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 你也是武士吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你是谁啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是铁刃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,是武士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,铁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你又是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫峰沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是女生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,女…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.48,0:07:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,是女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.19,0:07:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是女人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好酷…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的裤子好奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.45,0:07:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,女…女人好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（国际线出发 铁路）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.08,0:08:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,剑…剑十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,雷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我等这天等很久了 剑十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们今天做个了结吧\N-快点 雷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.10,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-刃 过来\N-好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 出租车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,刃 从今天开始
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是你家了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.98,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我家！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-等一下 你给我站住\N-超赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？哪来的小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我 你这狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,看来这小鬼不懂什么礼貌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天就来教你什么叫真正的剑道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.85,0:09:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,剑道是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿成这样 还敢说不知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,剑十郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是暂时借住一下罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.03,0:09:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不要擅自决定
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.95,0:09:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你也该有点分寸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,剑十郎 你跑来这里做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,老婆婆 你还活着啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸 你跟这只狒狒认识吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是剑十郎的崽子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那我可得好好教训你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,崽子是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要教训他啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.65,0:10:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-面…\N-胴…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-面！\N-胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-面！\N-哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好帅哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.42,0:10:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好多武士耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,要找谁当对手好呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}-好痛\N-好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 选这家伙就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他…他是这间道馆最强的武藤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 你有这么强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟那家伙比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.48,0:11:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,相对的 如果刃赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就要让我住在这个家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他才赢不了咧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-武藤 你跟这家伙打一场\N-咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.70,0:11:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不必手下留情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可…可是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那边嘀咕什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快点开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.83,0:11:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为这样\N我才不喜欢大猩猩跟狒狒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你这小鬼竟敢对老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼 你不用穿护具吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸说那是弱者才需要穿的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我从来没输给大猩猩过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知天高地厚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,双方就位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还真的不是只会嘴硬
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那挥法还挺锐利的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他挥太大力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,剑路一眼就看穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}好强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.52,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}根本打不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦 小鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要休息吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有时间让你休息啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 动作还真灵活
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你…在丛林里应该也能活下来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可不是丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,丛林…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 我记得他们那时候是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 别慌张
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不出来吗？那家伙破绽百出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,是…是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不过是只被逼急的老鼠在挣扎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.77,0:13:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是在砍猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.27,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是在砍气息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,面！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,什…什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,胴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.80,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好…好大的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.10,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶 赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然靠直觉就砍赢了武藤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这剑法也太乱来了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那这阵子就多多指教咯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你也差不多该安定下来了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喜欢自由自在\N这才符合我的性情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.55,0:15:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,弱肉强食 这可是自然的法则
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这里又不是丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,够了 你知道现在几点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太阳早就升起来了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,早餐好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,吃的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直很在意一件事…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么家里会有老虎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.77,0:16:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之前在丛林的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.73,0:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么这么难抓？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎样？别来碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就吃了你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么嘛？原来你是在帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.63,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好老虎耶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.18,0:16:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,从那时开始 影虎就成了我伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,什么伙伴…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来 剑十郎去哪了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早上还没看到他
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.06,0:16:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 你看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.77,0:16:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,“我出去一下 剩下的拜托了”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他写的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙…竟然丢下儿子…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.49,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他在丛林里常常这样自己跑掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 很像他会做出来的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我的菜不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.67,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是因为你吃太慢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,被抢走也不能怪别人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.17,0:17:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是自然的法则
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加 你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你不要跟来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,要去学校
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,学校是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,就是大家聚在一起学习的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,学习？是在修行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以那里应该有很多强者咯！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以到底有没有啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎么整你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.09,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 那边有超多超强的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你这种小咖一下子就会被吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.85,0:17:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这…这么强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.47,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.02,0:18:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能嘛？笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧 沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定会保护你的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你放心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此 里面有很多强者啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那…那个…刃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.91,0:18:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,其实…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手都在发痒了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}这…这个家怎么在叫啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,都说了这个不是家 是学校
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,原来学校是会叫的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,跟沙也加是什么关系？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.98,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,叫什么名字？几岁？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…他是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好多女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我等一下有早上的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在就给我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行\N-咦？为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.25,0:19:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才不是说了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有很多强的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这样\N我怎么可能丢下你自己回去？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,知…知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你听好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要乖乖待在旁边看哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太酷了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟沙也加家一样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里也有超多武士耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.94,0:19:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我先去换衣服 你乖乖待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,换衣服？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.41,0:19:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,烦死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我简直要发疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.79,0:19:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你好辣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪？怎么一点都不开心？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸明明说这样对方会很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.55,0:20:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太奇怪了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.80,0:20:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我竟然会蠢到误以为他人还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙果然是个怪咖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 那家伙超怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.29,0:20:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.75,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是道场的东西 不准乱碰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.72,0:20:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,完全感受不到他的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.43,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.31,0:20:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙很强吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.64,0:20:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？他当然强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.73,0:20:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是全国大赛冠军耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.65,0:20:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这样子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你来跟我打一场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要跟你这种人…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.49,0:21:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,呜啦 来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吼！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,嗷呜！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-呜啦 来这边 呜啦…\N-你这个搞笑小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.98,0:21:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这里可不是小鬼的游乐场所
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是铁刃 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我吗？我是鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸猛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.38,0:21:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是刃与他永远的宿敌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.96,0:22:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸猛之间的第一次相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫峰沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.69,0:23:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,3月3日生 14岁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是峰道场中的独生女
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.52,0:23:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,现在正努力修行中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不过啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得下周会发生不得了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 苏醒的风神剑之卷
